From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 01:19:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] schedsvc: Report version 1.6 of the task schema.

The definitions the service stores are now those of Windows 10 1709,
which rpcapi already accepts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit c8d033d2b18980cfc4a08d0828d03add3e1d72b1)

diff --git a/dlls/schedsvc/schedsvc.c b/dlls/schedsvc/schedsvc.c
index 784fc5d944d..fd66327d268 100644
--- a/dlls/schedsvc/schedsvc.c
+++ b/dlls/schedsvc/schedsvc.c
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ HRESULT __cdecl SchRpcHighestVersion(DWORD *version)
 {
     TRACE("%p\n", version);
 
-    *version = MAKELONG(3, 1);
+    *version = MAKELONG(6, 1);
     return S_OK;
 }
 
